[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0128","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0128.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1593","title":"GNU a2ps 不安全文件创建漏洞","description":"a2ps 4.14 及之前版本中 lib/routines.h 文件的 tempname_ensure 函数在创建临时文件时未进行安全处理，被 spy_user 等函数调用时存在不安全的临时文件创建漏洞。本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击利用该漏洞，在受影响系统上以运行 a2ps 进程的用户权限修改任意文件，导致权限提升或文件破坏。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，但需要本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1593"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2014-04-05T21:55:06.097","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:33.777","remediation":"升级 a2ps 至 4.13b 以上已修复版本，该版本修复了 lib/routines.h 中 tempname_ensure 函数的临时文件创建方式，避免使用可预测路径名。如无法升级，作为临时缓解措施确保 /tmp 目录权限为 1777（粘滞位），限制本地低权限用户对临时目录的写入替换能力。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://pkgs.fedoraproject.org/cgit/a2ps.git/plain/a2ps-4.13-security.patch","http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2014/q1/237","http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2014/q1/253","http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2014/q1/257","http://www.debian.org/security/2014/dsa-2892","https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=737385","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1060630","https://github.com/jsonn/pkgsrc/blob/c1514b5f4a3726d90e30aa16b0c209adbc276d17/print/a2ps/patches/patch-CVE-2001-1593_1","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1593.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1593","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2001/UBUNTU-CVE-2001-1593.json","https://github.com/frugalware/kde5/blob/5d51d2db65802d1cae2ee918816f9ca6a6b550f4/source/apps-extra/a2ps/CVE-2001-1593.patch","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-1593.md","https://github.com/gnummers/gentoo-optimized/blob/3b1c3b513005aef0f21480f98a42941c3213c47e/usr/portage/app-text/a2ps/files/a2ps-4.14-CVE-2001-1593.patch","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1593.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2001-1593","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2014/deb_2892.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0128.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0111","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1413","title":"ncompress 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"ncompress 4.2.4 及更早版本的 comprexx 函数中存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。当该工具被用于跨越安全边界的场景（如 FTP 服务器处理文件名时），远程攻击者可通过提交超长文件名参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响广泛使用 ncompress 的 Unix/Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至 4.2.4 以上版本或应用厂商补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1413"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2004-12-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:13.530","remediation":"升级 ncompress 至 4.2.4-r1 或更高版本。Gentoo 系统执行 `emerge \">=app-arch/ncompress-4.2.4-r1\"`；Red Hat 系统安装 RHSA-2004-536 提供的更新包。如无法立即升级，可在服务层面限制调用 compress/uncompress 的守护进程（如 FTP 服务器）的输入参数长度作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/lists/vuln-dev/2001/Nov/0202.html","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-200410-08.xml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/176363","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2004-536.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10619","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1413.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1413","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-1413.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1413.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2001-1413","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2004-536.nasl","https://github.com/gentoo-mirror/gentoo/blob/9ece7e5620d0e75f5e0f629df3606daa1bb7fbe4/metadata/glsa/glsa-200410-08.xml","https://github.com/tumblr1978/SecurityDataUsage/blob/fbec2cf82c02c3a21131dc1c1bc5d2c453e004c4/papersTotalTXT/sec12-final227.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_145400_145500.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2001-1413"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0374","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0374.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1175","title":"util-linux vipw 影子文件权限配置错误漏洞","description":"tags.<value>util-linux 软件包中的 vipw 工具在 2.10 版本之前存在权限配置缺陷，导致 /etc/shadow 密码哈希文件在部分场景下被设置为全局可读。此漏洞使本地攻击者无需额外权限即可读取密码哈希数据，进而通过暴力破解手段尝试获取用户密码。攻击条件为攻击者需具备本地账户访问权限，影响范围涵盖使用 util-linux 2.10 之前版本的 Linux 发行版系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1175"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-04-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:43.823","remediation":"升级 util-linux 到 ≥2.10 版本以修复 /etc/shadow 权限漏洞，然后验证 root 所有文件权限已正确设置，不再 world-readable。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-095.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-132.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3036","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6851","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1175.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1175","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1175.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1175.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cmf2-f2q8-mr4f/GHSA-cmf2-f2q8-mr4f.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1175.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1175.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b04888a3-bb90-4fe3-ae3f-1d117c80d736.json","https://github.com/animalyoung/attackmap/blob/c35b10ce77b910d0e12302802f22b79bd3fcbde0/attack_map/resources/views/onemap/Asia/bruteresult.txt","https://github.com/dmc5179/rhsa-tools/blob/677b19c223fe2771414f7b2fc89b4a4f39d25719/cvrfs/RHSA-2001:095.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0374.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0374.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0372","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0372.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1174","title":"Elm 2.5.5 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"Elm 邮件客户端（2.5.5 及更早版本）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送包含超长 Message-ID 头部的特制电子邮件触发该漏洞，无需身份认证即可在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有使用 Elm 2.5.5 及之前版本的用户，攻击条件宽松，利用方式简单，危害等级较高。漏洞于 2002 年 4 月 1 日由 NVD 正式发布。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1174"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-04-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:43.710","remediation":"立即升级到 Elm 2.14 或更高版本，完全修复缓冲区溢出漏洞；修改 /etc/elm/elm.rc 文件，禁用自动加载主题功能并限制 Message-ID 头部长度至 1024 字节以下；如无法立即升级，可通过 iptables 策略阻止源端口 143 的SMTP流量进行临时缓解","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-067.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5451","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-091.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6852","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1174.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1174","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1174.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1174.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2wqx-2fx4-v9vv/GHSA-2wqx-2fx4-v9vv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1174.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-067.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148300_148400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1174.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--86b78d9e-0fdb-4810-befb-fa6d061670eb.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0372.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0339","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0339.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0887","title":"xSANE xSANE 临时文件安全漏洞","description":"xSANE 0.81 及更早版本在处理临时文件时存在不安全的符号链接处理缺陷，本地攻击者可通过在共享临时目录中创建指向其他用户文件的恶意符号链接，诱导 xSANE 以目标用户权限打开并写入该链接指向的文件，从而实现跨用户边界的任意文件修改。攻击前提要求攻击者具备本地系统访问权限，并能预测或控制 xSANE 创建临时文件的路径与时机，利用竞争条件在文件创建与打开的时间窗口内替换符号链接目标。成功利用将导致受害用户文件被篡改、覆盖或破坏，破坏多用户环境下的文件隔离机制，虽 CVSS 仅 1.2 分（低危），但在共享扫描服务器等多用户场景下仍具实质破坏潜力。建议升级至 xSANE 0.82 以上版本，或配置粘滞位保护 /tmp 目录、设置私有 TMPDIR 等缓解措施。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0887"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-01-15T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:09.727","remediation":"建议升级 xSANE 至 0.82 或更高版本（Debian 用户可通过 apt upgrade xsane 获取 DSA-706 修复版本）。临时缓解措施：为 /tmp 目录设置粘滞位（chmod +t /tmp），限制普通用户只能删除自己的临时文件；或在用户环境中设置 TMPDIR 指向用户私有目录（如 ~/tmp 且 chmod 700），避免在共享临时目录创建可预测文件名。若无法升级，建议限制 xSANE 仅由受信用户使用，或通过 AppArmor/SELinux 策略限制其对 /tmp 的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-171.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-172.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/3734","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3700","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7714","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0887.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0887","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0887.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0887.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8x27-5m5c-3wv8/GHSA-8x27-5m5c-3wv8.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0887.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/debian_DSA-706.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0887.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148200_148300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1c39b261-6fd9-4a21-93aa-041979d0b63d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0339.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0125","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0125.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1562","title":"nvi 格式化字符串本地权限提升漏洞","description":"nvi（一款 vi 文本编辑器克隆）1.79 之前版本中存在格式化字符串漏洞。当用户使用 nvi 打开或处理包含格式化字符串占位符（如 %s、%n 等）的特制文件名时，程序未对文件名中的格式化字符串进行正确过滤，导致攻击者可利用该漏洞以当前用户权限执行任意代码。本地攻击者只需构造一个包含恶意格式化字符串的文件名并诱使目标用户（或通过自动化脚本）使用 nvi 打开该文件，即可触发漏洞，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 nvi 1.79 之前的所有版本，CVSS v2.0 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1562"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:30.767","remediation":"升级 nvi 至 1.79 或更高版本以修复格式化字符串漏洞。如无法升级，可限制受影响用户对 nvi 的执行权限，或移除 nvi 的 setuid 位作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100526142205694&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-085","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7317.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3456","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1562.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1562","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-1562.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1562.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7jv7-g8h7-56pp/GHSA-7jv7-g8h7-56pp.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/debian_DSA-085.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1562.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d7ea6f4b-2028-475d-b894-118b544addca.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0125.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0123","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0123.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1534","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_usertrack 可预测会话ID安全绕过漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.11 至 1.3.20 版本的 mod_usertrack 模块在生成会话标识符（Session ID）时使用了可预测的信息，包括主机 IP 地址、系统时间和服务器进程 ID。本地攻击者可通过预测或计算这些会话 ID 来劫持其他用户的会话，从而绕过身份认证机制，获取未授权访问权限。该漏洞源于会话 ID 生成算法缺乏足够的随机性，属于设计缺陷。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1534"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:27.367","remediation":"升级 Apache 至 1.3.20 以上版本以修复 mod_usertrack 的 Session ID 可预测问题；如无法升级，应避免将 mod_usertrack 生成的 Session ID 用于用户认证，改用 mod_session 等安全模块管理会话。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2001/11/msg00084.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7494.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3521","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1534.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1534","https://github.com/OWASP/pytm/blob/86ccaa8601f19af69ed87fe0c171e520e3f30cf4/docs/threats.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-1534.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1534.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/low/Apache%20mod_usertrack%E5%8F%AF%E9%A2%84%E8%A8%80ID%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2001-1534).html","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1534.yaml","https://github.com/sdnewhop/grinder/blob/7432531e4a5a4ce3cc8224ac852188ef1d18432d/samples/062019-f5-bigip-hashes/csv/vulnerability.csv","https://github.com/mitre/cti/blob/ea1adfe1a68ca3dcfe2dd883180b8cf10a988824/capec/2.0/attack-pattern/attack-pattern--7ee89c1f-50a5-42e6-abdb-6d8ba0349810.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1534.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0123.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0123.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0121","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1507","title":"OpenSSH OpenSSH Kerberos认证绕过漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 在启用 Kerberos V 认证时存在身份验证绕过漏洞。由于 OpenSSH 3.0.1 之前版本中 Kerberos V 认证模块未能正确验证用户身份，远程攻击者可在无需有效凭据的情况下直接登录目标系统，获得未经授权的访问权限。该漏洞影响启用 Kerberos V 认证的 OpenSSH 服务，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。OpenBSD 已发布安全补丁修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1507"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:24.113","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 至 3.0.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Kerberos V 认证绕过问题。如无法立即升级，可在 sshd_config 中将 KerberosAuthentication 设为 no 以禁用 Kerberos 认证，或通过防火墙限制对 SSH 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://msgs.securepoint.com/cgi-bin/get/bugtraq0111/114.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7598.php","http://www.openbsd.org/errata30.html#sshd","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3560","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1507.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1507","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-1507.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1507.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mg6j-7hwf-j46v/GHSA-mg6j-7hwf-j46v.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2001/CVE-2001-1507","https://github.com/threatworx/twigs/blob/b2648a584b661b338aa18dfdbfd4ff236fd07773/twigs/ssh-audit.py","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/O/openssh_301.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1507.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0120","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0120.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1505","title":"tinc VPN 重放攻击漏洞","description":"tinc 1.0pre3 及 1.0pre4 版本存在重放攻击漏洞。远程攻击者可通过嗅探网络流量并重放捕获的数据包，向用户会话中注入恶意数据，导致会话劫持或数据篡改。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击者仅需具备网络监听能力即可实施攻击，无需认证。此漏洞影响 tinc VPN 早期预览版本，建议升级至更新版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1505"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:23.890","remediation":"升级到 tinc 1.0pre5 或更高版本，该版本修复了数据包重放攻击问题。建议直接升级到最新的 tinc 1.1 稳定版，该版本使用全新协议并修复了所有已知安全弱点。如无法升级，可在 tinc 配置中启用 MACLength 选项并设置为完整 HMAC 长度以增强数据包认证强度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/249142","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3837","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7870","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1505.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1505","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-1505.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1505.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2jvh-95r9-r8rh/GHSA-2jvh-95r9-r8rh.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1505.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--49e592da-e9cf-4e90-aaf7-f7201aad49b2.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2001/CVE-2001-1505","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/ee86c26ee0202761283d7d612909ed4cc8981bf7/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0120.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0119","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0119.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1494","title":"util-linux script 命令任意文件写入漏洞","description":"util-linux 软件包中的 script 命令在 2.11n 版本之前存在任意文件写入漏洞（CWE-59）。本地攻击者可通过将 typescript 日志文件硬链接到系统中的任意文件，然后诱导 root 用户执行 script 命令，导致攻击者能够覆盖系统任意文件内容。该漏洞利用条件为需要本地访问权限，危害等级中危，CVSS 评分 5.5。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1494"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:22.617","remediation":"升级 util-linux 至 2.11n 及以上版本，该版本修复了 script 命令在处理 typescript 日志文件时未正确检查硬链接的问题。如无法立即升级，可移除 script 命令的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/script）作为临时缓解措施，或限制非授信用户对 script 命令的访问。攻击者需本地登录权限，因此做好用户访问控制也可降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2001/Dec/0122.html","http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2001/Dec/0123.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/16785","http://secunia.com/advisories/18502","http://support.avaya.com/elmodocs2/security/ASA-2006-014.htm","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2005-782.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/16280","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7718","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A10723","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2001/CVE-2001-1494.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1494.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1494","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e