5:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:09.583","remediation":"升级 glibc 到包含修复的版本（如 glibc 2.2.4+，该版本修复了 2001 年 CVE-2001-0886 中的 glob 函数缓冲区溢漏洞）。如果使用较旧的系统(如 Red Hat Linux 7.0、Mandrake 8.x)，请立即应用相应的安全补丁。当前大多数现代 Linux 发行版（Debian 11+、Ubuntu 18.04+、CentOS 8+）均已包含修复。已修复且认可的系统无需额外缓解措施，但残留的系统应保持锁定的权限并限制网络访问 glob 函数的可执行程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000447","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-037-01","http://sources.redhat.com/ml/bug-glibc/2001-11/msg00109.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/m-029.shtml","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-103","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-095.php3","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1752.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-160.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/245956","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3707","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBTL0112-008","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7705","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0886.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0886.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0886","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0886.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-29c9-5v6h-437j/GHSA-29c9-5v6h-437j.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-